# Claude Code (worktrees / agent dir)
.claude/

# Packed desktop-extension bundles are build artifacts, not source. They are
# distributed as GitHub release assets (see every release from 1.0.2 on), so a
# copy in the repo is a duplicate that goes stale the moment a version ships —
# 1.0.6 sat here through three releases. Build with:
#   npm prune --omit=dev && npx --yes @anthropic-ai/mcpb pack && npm install
*.mcpb
